    "title": "PS23333 -  Go-Science TSI S&T Professionals Survey",
    "description": "***** THIS IS AN AWARD NOTICE, NOT A CALL FOR COMPETITION *****\r\n\r\nThis procurement is being concluded following a mini competition under the RM6126 DPS Research & Insights Framework\r\n\r\nBrief Description of Requirement\r\n\r\nExpert Survey\r\nTSI would like to collect data on problems, opportunities and trends in the UK S&T \r\necosystem and their relative importance. Specifically, TSI would like to commission a \r\nsupplier to:-\r\n1) Conduct an online survey of S&T professionals that identifies opportunities, \r\nproblems and trends within the UK's S&T ecosystem.\r\n2) Analyse and report the survey responses",
